                text    md
                lines
                    |# Sheets|
                    ||
                    Every **text node** is a full *editor state*.
                    ||
                    |## Features|
                    ||
                    - word wrap with indent
                    - multi cursors across nodes
                    - novim in every node
                    - syntax colors per `language`
                    ||
                    |### Keys|
                    ||
                    1. `alt+n` toggles novim
                    2. `cmd+down` adds a cursor
                    3. `shift+alt+=` scales a node
                    ||
                    > scale comes only from node.scale
                    ||
                    See [the plan](plan/popo.md) for details.
